;; ESH-0101 guard coverage — FAIL-CLOSED probe.
;; A raise that no guard catches must terminate the program: nonzero exit, a
;; diagnostic on stderr, and NOTHING printed past the raising form. The
;; MUST-NOT-PRINT sentinel makes a fail-open regression (a swallowed raise
;; that lets execution continue) impossible to miss.
(display "BEFORE ")
(raise (quote unhandled-condition))
(display "MUST-NOT-PRINT")
